{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e329","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0adcf-af6f-7db0-8726-470499e8596b"},"sequence":4079,"recorded_at":1780531400008153,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"3b578cbb-cd1c-4970-859d-8c242cd48356","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"3b578cbb-cd1c-4970-859d-8c242cd48356","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"3b578cbb-cd1c-4970-859d-8c242cd48356"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0adee-7af0-7760-b046-6f14e876684f"},"task_id":"01a0adee-7af0-7760-b046-6f14e876684f","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0adee-7af0-7760-b046-6f14e876684f","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-115-1\",\n  \"command\": \"grep -rn \\\"Measured coverage\\\\|Fifty-six\\\\|fifty-six\\\" internal/ --include=\\\"*_test.go\\\" | head; echo \\\"===\\\"; sed -n '2777,2800p' README.md\",\n  \"description\": \"Check prose pins and read rest\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"===\\nOne admitted binding out of fifty-six covers a single clause, and it is\\ndisclosed here rather than hidden: without Section 6.2 the admit path would only\\never be exercised synthetically. Its discharge is no longer positive-only: the\\nnative-Windows lanes carry the positive arm and\\n`TestDecodeRefusesNonConptyBackendOnNativeWindows` the legacy refusal arm,\\nboth registered against the `config-versioned-readers` acceptance case.\\n\\nThat is a disclosure of the shipped state, not a target that was met.\\n`TestRunRefusesEveryAssignedSectionThatOnlySlivers` and\\n`TestVerifyAssignedSectionsRefusesEveryBindingThatOnlySlivers` pin every failing\\nbinding with its exact measured ratio, so a section that becomes covered has to\\nleave those tables deliberately. Five further gaps the disclosure surfaced:\\nSection 15.2's code-to-exit registry is implemented in\\n[`internal/axerror`](internal/axerror) and checked row by row, 